ns X` by minimal open neighbourhoods `nhdsKer {x}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.cechH2EquivCofinal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.cechH2EquivCofinal","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechCofinalCover.lean#L101-L107","doc":"**`Ȟ²` is `H²` of a cofinal cover.** If an admissible cover `𝒰₀` refines every\nadmissible cover, the colimit `Ȟ²` is in bijection with `H²(𝒰₀)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.toCech_toCofinal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.toCech_toCofinal","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechCofinalCover.lean#L94-L99","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.toCofinal_toCech","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.toCofinal_toCech","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechCofinalCover.lean#L80-L91","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.toCofinal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.toCofinal","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechCofinalCover.lean#L75-L77","doc":"**The map `Ȟ² → H²(𝒰₀)`** to a cofinal admissible cover. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.toCofinalAux_step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.toCofinalAux_step","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9f